::BeforeSupplyChainCh10

@trigger 	OnOverarhcing 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}    Hey Cowboy. Got another hauler available for you.
{@Player}   Great. I could use some good news.
{@Quinn}    Well... it's fully automated.
{@Quinn}    And ...it's slow.
{@Player}   Of course it is.
{@Quinn}    Hey, another ship means fewer bottlenecks. Sometimes having an extra hauler matters more than having a fast one.
{@Player}   I'll take it.

//spreading hazards causing delays from more inspections
{@Quinn}    You'll need it. Frontier's stopping ships along so many of the routes now.
{@Quinn}	They're lookin' for pirates
{@Player}   Callie's people?
{@Quinn}    Among others. Inspections are backing everybody up.
{@Player}   So more delays.
{@Quinn}    Yep. Keep an eye on your routes.



::AfterSupplyChainCh10
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once


//reminder of money due threat and now its coming from dorian. 
{@MAL}      C-Captain! Y0u h@ve a l-letter from... Fr0ntier Robotics!
{@Player}   Of course I do.

{@MAL}      "Captain Locke Sawyer: This is a reminder that your final payment deadline for the Constance is approaching."
{@MAL}      "Failure to meet your financial obligation by the specified date will result in repossession of the vessel by Frontier Robotics."
{@MAL}      "We appreciate your continued partnership!"


